# Third-party binaries, downloads, sandbox HOME and throwaway indexes are not for committing.
# Only the documentation and the audit scripts are kept. The audit snapshots list entries of the
# user's home directory and the smoke outputs carry absolute local paths, so both stay untracked.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/_audit/
/_audit/user_config_*.txt
/_audit/snapshot_user_config.sh
